  "question": {
    "text": "In the following sequence of reactions:<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Toluene</mi><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>KMnO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>SOCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>BaSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mi>Pd</mi></mrow></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math><br /><br />The Product <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is:",
